_assets/steam/apps/1702170/extras/3a28e3a830879c5da5349489b565532e.poster.avif?t=1729209466\" width=620 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702170/extras/3a28e3a830879c5da5349489b565532e.webm?t=1729209466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702170/extras/3a28e3a830879c5da5349489b565532e.mp4?t=1729209466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play with or without spiders<br></li><li>From friendly spiders to aggressive spiders</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Few modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Poisonous air : continuously drains your life, heal yourself by bumping into particular spider.<br></li><li>No straying : makes your game challenging, as you have limited amount of steps.<br></li><li>Kill more than golden spider : you compete with golden spider for most kills.</li></ul>", "short_description": "'epic maze' is a third-person shooter game in which you must find your way to the gramophone in a procedurally generated 3d maze by following its music, turn it off, and then return. remember your path, do not get lost in maze. Original new concept. One of a kind. Replayable custom game.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Overall, I thoroughly enjoyed playing Epic Maze; I used to create mazes for my children when they were young. The ability to configure the game so many ways and the fact that no two levels with the same settings will ever be the same du to procedurally generated levels add to the re-playability. The only negative I have to say about this game is that there is little to differentiate between each room. I'd like to see different decorative schemes that would give the appearance of difference mansions; still the aim of the game is to solve mazes, so it's only a minor gripe.”<br>recommended – Giveaway of the 